cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tcswebasm: the TCSpecial examples running in a web browser"
abstract: >-
  tcswebasm runs TCSpecial's flight software, built from TCSpecial's own
  source for WebAssembly, in a web page, with nothing to install. Its
  programs run as threads of the page, talking to one another over a
  network held in the page's memory, at the addresses their
  configurations give, so that what is shown is the software that runs
  on a desk, simulated throughout.
authors:
  - name: "TCSpecial Team"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/vomlehn/tcswebasm"
url: "https://vomlehn.github.io/tcswebasm/docs/manual.html"
keywords:
  - flight software
  - WebAssembly
  - browser
  - simulation
  - Rust
